      "remediated_chinese_text": "特别股东大会除依照本法规定所享有的职权外，还可以就原属普通股东大会职权范围内的事项作出决议，但应遵守与普通股东大会相同的条件和程序。",
      "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "56f293fd8116b3e92a9bdcdc65921c8919e0516e4f6314d3a468cb8b7759b49d",
      "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "085582611cb975a00965fe8e2565f6a84bd3fd77160a4568ae6e23e3882b5540",
      "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "f031cda97ccb436540b55ad89d3264f3c2152e14e2be9cff6d56f66a57dbdd5f",
      "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
